    "vLLM HTTPS address": { "extractionState": "manual", "localizations": { "de": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "vLLM-HTTPS-Adresse" } } } },
    "OpenAI receives your request and relevant visualization state. Render images are sent only if you enable sharing below.": { "extractionState": "manual", "localizations": { "de": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "OpenAI erhält deine Anfrage und den relevanten Darstellungszustand. Renderbilder werden nur übertragen, wenn du sie unten freigibst." } } } },
