    "The assistant sends your text, visualization state and, if allowed, render images to your configured server. It can change the current visualization. No camera or passthrough images are sent.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The assistant sends your text, visualization state and, if allowed, render images to your configured server. It can change the current visualization. No camera or passthrough images are sent."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Der Assistent sendet Ihren Text, den Darstellungszustand und, sofern erlaubt, Renderbilder an Ihren eingestellten Server. Er kann die aktuelle Darstellung verändern. Kamera- und Passthrough-Bilder werden nicht übertragen."
          }
        }
      }
